OpenCodex Desktop

OpenCodex Desktop is an independent fork of DeepSeek GUI with the same Kun runtime contract and local-first workflow.

Source and ownership:
- Upstream: https://github.com/XingYu-Zhong/DeepSeek-GUI (preserved as upstream)
- Fork origin: https://github.com/azzab/opencodex-desktop

This project is not affiliated with DeepSeek Inc.

Attribution:
- DeepSeek GUI / Kun: foundational runtime and product lineage.
- Codex: guidance compass for architecture and decisions.
- Other systems: active benchmarks and references.
